# LF everywhere, including on a Windows checkout.
#
# Git rewrites line endings to CRLF on Windows by default. The formatter expects
# LF, so it reported every file in the repository as needing a rewrite and the
# first CI run failed on `tsconfig.json` — a file nobody had touched. The diff it
# printed was invisible: only the line endings differed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must not touch. `playground.sqlite` is committed on purpose: it
# carries the seed rows the playground's tests read.
*.sqlite binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
